Package: msProteomiX
Title: Multi-Engine Mass Spectrometry Proteomics Data Processing
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Xi", "Wang", email = "wangxi@bayomics.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A comprehensive R package for processing and visualizing mass 
    spectrometry proteomics data from multiple search engines including FragPipe, 
    MaxQuant, Proteome Discoverer, and DIA-NN. Supports standard DDA proteomics, 
    AP-MS (affinity purification), and phosphoproteomics workflows. Designed for 
    interactive use in RStudio with user-friendly Chinese-language guided scripts.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
